  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simayu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu:p001:m0000" ref="7ra_yru_xbm">始平哀王裕</persName>，字濬度，咸寧三年受封，其年薨，年七歲。無子，以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu:p001:m0029" ref="7y2_w80_i71">淮南王允</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu:p001:m0034" ref="9r1_pd9_4bo">迪</persName>為嗣。太康十年，改封漢王，為<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu:p001:m0049" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG">趙王倫</persName>所害。</p>
</text>
